WEBVTT

00:01.754 --> 00:03.340
2020

00:03.340 --> 00:04.760
NOVEMBER 30TH

00:04.760 --> 00:06.304
23:40

00:10.187 --> 00:11.231
Mr. Billy?

00:11.649 --> 00:12.609
What's up?

00:13.401 --> 00:16.324
Why did you put on your spurs again today?

00:16.324 --> 00:17.661
Why?

00:20.165 --> 00:22.461
To use the sound
to see around me, of course.

00:22.712 --> 00:26.094
I know that!
But you have me!

00:26.094 --> 00:27.304
You don't need them!

00:28.265 --> 00:31.772
I told you I'd be your eyes
no matter what, didn't I?

00:34.778 --> 00:35.947
Yeah.

00:35.947 --> 00:39.538
I need you... Tatiana.

02:13.016 --> 02:16.022
<i>Chikara returned to Japan
and had regained his everyday life.</i>

02:16.022 --> 02:19.613
<i>But that was a fleeting reality existing only
until he makes his decision.</i>

02:19.946 --> 02:25.123
<i>Fuko and Andy, in order to know Chikara's choice
as a Negator, head to his school.</i>

02:25.457 --> 02:28.463
<i>That is where Rip, who they
supposedly defeated, shows up.</i>

02:28.463 --> 02:30.968
<i>Upon touching a gun Artifact
that Rip tossed over as "a gift,"</i>

02:30.968 --> 02:34.559
<i>Fuko and Andy see visions
of memories residing within...</i>

02:35.143 --> 02:37.690
<i>...the shadow of God who will destroy this world.</i>

02:38.191 --> 02:42.407
<i>Andy boasts that he will defeat even God
to forge his own destiny,</i>

02:42.407 --> 02:44.370
<i>and Rip heartily laughs hearing that.</i>

02:44.788 --> 02:50.173
<i>Calling themselves "Under," Rip forecasts
a drastic change in three months' time and leaves.</i>

02:50.633 --> 02:53.597
<i>Meanwhile, Chikara thinks back on his misfortune.</i>

02:53.597 --> 02:57.354
<i>He decides to abandon his everyday life
to join the Union and fight.</i>

02:57.814 --> 03:02.699
<i>Seeing Chikara act as such,
Fuko also reaffirms her resolve.</i>

03:03.241 --> 03:05.580
<i>Time flies by,
and it is now December 1st.</i>

03:05.997 --> 03:10.046
<i>Apocalypse opens up,
and new quests are about to be declared.</i>

03:14.556 --> 03:16.017
2020

03:16.017 --> 03:17.520
DECEMBER 1ST

03:17.520 --> 03:19.023
MIDNIGHT

03:19.023 --> 03:20.526
UNION FACILITY,
ROUNDTABLE ROOM

03:37.518 --> 03:38.604
We're all assembled, yes?

03:39.438 --> 03:41.568
You may proceed, Apocalypse.

03:41.777 --> 03:44.616
Quests, open!

03:59.228 --> 04:03.444
These quests have the 100th penalty at stake.

04:04.989 --> 04:08.789
This round, every quest is open to everyone.

04:08.997 --> 04:13.674
<i>Every living person on Earth
will have the right to participate.</i>

04:13.799 --> 04:17.347
Open to everyone...
So, here it is.

04:17.472 --> 04:20.563
There are four quests this time.

04:20.813 --> 04:22.775
Quest one:

04:23.109 --> 04:26.240
<i>Neutralization of UMA Spring.</i>

04:26.490 --> 04:31.167
Location of Artifact Aegis.

04:31.668 --> 04:33.129
Quest two:

04:33.589 --> 04:36.343
<i>Neutralization of UMA Summer.</i>

04:36.762 --> 04:40.936
Location of Negator Unchange.

04:44.611 --> 04:46.447
Quest three:

04:46.782 --> 04:49.662
<i>Capture of UMA Autumn.</i>

04:49.954 --> 04:54.046
Addition of UMA Ghost.

04:57.845 --> 04:59.808
Quest four:

04:59.933 --> 05:03.565
Neutralization of UMA Winter.

05:03.774 --> 05:08.742
Location of Artifact Remember.

05:10.161 --> 05:14.044
Quest deadline: December 31st.

05:14.044 --> 05:18.427
If all quests are not fulfilled by the deadline,
the penalty will be...

05:22.477 --> 05:26.193
<i>...the addition of UMA Revolution!</i>

05:26.570 --> 05:28.699
R-Revolution?

05:29.116 --> 05:32.080
So open to everyone applies
to people like Mui, too.

05:32.582 --> 05:33.542
Yes.

05:34.084 --> 05:36.840
People outside of the Roundtable
are free to enter.

05:37.340 --> 05:39.846
It means we're facing opponents
of that grand a scale.

05:40.556 --> 05:42.560
Roundtable or not,
everyone must unite to challenge them.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.812
Mind if I jump in?

05:47.193 --> 05:49.031
What is it, Billy?

05:49.323 --> 05:54.542
Like Apocalypse said,
these quests hold the 100th penalty.

05:54.918 --> 05:57.297
I doubt we will complete them that easily.

05:58.174 --> 06:03.602
If some of us die before we get
a shot at the 101st penalty...

06:03.602 --> 06:06.273
...that seals the deal on our defeat, right?

06:06.733 --> 06:09.781
Three out of four need
to be neutralized.

06:11.367 --> 06:12.745
If we can kill them, we're good.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.707
So...

06:15.208 --> 06:17.880
...why don't we just drop
a few nukes on 'em?

06:30.948 --> 06:33.494
What... are you saying, Mr. Billy?

06:34.329 --> 06:37.127
If we do that,
then innocent people will be sacrificed-

06:37.127 --> 06:39.256
Yeah, that's true.

06:39.841 --> 06:41.928
But that's all that we'd lose.

06:41.970 --> 06:42.805
Huh?

06:43.598 --> 06:47.105
Too naive, Juiz... you really are.

06:49.151 --> 06:51.656
You're always seeking a better outcome.

06:51.656 --> 06:54.369
Almost as if there'll be a next time.

06:55.163 --> 06:56.833
What are you driving at?

06:57.585 --> 06:59.922
I'm saying it's impossible.

06:59.922 --> 07:03.597
You can repeat it thousands-
tens of thousands-of times, but you...

07:03.889 --> 07:05.559
None of you...

07:07.312 --> 07:09.274
Are able to kill God.

07:26.601 --> 07:29.690
<i>The odd feeling I've had
since Unseen got taken...</i>

07:31.026 --> 07:35.911
Item six: Capture of Negator Unseen... failed.

07:36.830 --> 07:38.667
How very unfortunate.

07:39.000 --> 07:39.669
Huh?

07:39.919 --> 07:41.548
We had an inkling.

07:41.840 --> 07:45.012
The guys that went to investigate Unseen all died.

07:45.346 --> 07:49.564
<i>Their bound bodies ended up in
a deserted area, and all of 'em...</i>

07:49.981 --> 07:51.441
<i>...bled to death.</i>

07:51.985 --> 07:56.160
My guess is Unseen got taken by Unrepair.

07:58.122 --> 08:01.253
<i>Those guys barging in everywhere we went...</i>

08:03.132 --> 08:09.812
We are Under. In three months,
the world will flip around and become fair.

08:09.979 --> 08:11.816
<i>Calling all off-mission members!</i>

08:12.317 --> 08:17.202
<i>Roundtable members are currently battling
Negator Hunters in Egypt and China.</i>

08:20.041 --> 08:23.297
Join us, and I'll personally put in
a good word for you two.

08:24.174 --> 08:27.180
<i>What he hinted at...
Don't tell me-</i>

08:29.309 --> 08:31.940
First time in this sort of situation, Juiz?

08:32.398 --> 08:34.862
You're mighty slow to make the calls.

08:35.071 --> 08:36.574
Isshin! Isshin!

08:39.705 --> 08:42.335
You gotta help Isshin, old timer!
You gotta!

08:42.335 --> 08:45.968
I'm well aware! First, remove their armor
so I can assess the wound!

08:46.176 --> 08:49.307
I managed to bump off Unbreakable, eh?
Good job.

08:50.769 --> 08:52.355
Top, don't do it!

09:00.246 --> 09:05.172
N-No! What are you doing, Top?

09:05.172 --> 09:07.803
Mr. Billy is... he's...

09:08.053 --> 09:12.103
You dummy!
He shot at us... He shot Isshin!

09:12.437 --> 09:14.650
It's clear that he's a traitor!

09:30.473 --> 09:36.527
Devoid of light, bearing the burden
of Negating, forced to fight.

09:42.581 --> 09:45.127
Why lament about lives
of the incompetent?

09:46.004 --> 09:49.595
Utilize their lives as well.
That's what I'd do.

09:49.595 --> 09:51.139
Otherwise...

09:54.647 --> 09:56.024
...it's quite Unfair, yes?

10:01.661 --> 10:07.840
The Roundtable will belong to Under-
I'll be taking it.

10:10.929 --> 10:14.310
The one who'll kill God... is me.

11:00.529 --> 11:04.787
Wha? What's going on?
Did Mr. Billy just betray us?

11:04.787 --> 11:05.872
Seems so.

11:08.043 --> 11:10.757
Uh... Tatiana! Th-This is...

11:10.799 --> 11:12.719
Heya, guys!
Long time no see!

11:13.763 --> 11:14.682
Unrepair!

11:15.099 --> 11:17.019
And... his wife!

11:18.313 --> 11:19.817
That what it looks like?

11:20.192 --> 11:21.278
It's nothing like that!

11:23.198 --> 11:27.498
Huh? You lost weight since I last saw you?
You've gotten prettier, maybe?

11:27.624 --> 11:28.375
Huh?

11:28.543 --> 11:32.718
I-I guess! I did do a lot
of training these past two months!

11:32.843 --> 11:36.976
Sorry, you're far away,
so I can't really tell. Might be just me!

11:41.359 --> 11:42.571
That seals it.

11:43.113 --> 11:46.662
If he's with those two,
Billy is a part of Under-

11:46.746 --> 11:47.789
No!

11:48.081 --> 11:51.839
That isn't Mr. Billy!
You don't know the first thing about him!

11:52.173 --> 11:56.056
Top broke that guy's neck a second ago,
but he repaired himself!

11:59.855 --> 12:02.611
Mr. Billy's ability doesn't work like that!

12:03.028 --> 12:05.950
Mr. Billy's ability is Unbelievable.

12:10.710 --> 12:14.760
It's limited to guns, but shooting in
a direction that'd never hit his target...

12:14.760 --> 12:17.641
...he always hits via ricochets and stuff.
It's a sure-hit ability!

12:22.024 --> 12:26.074
It's the truth!
I'm the only one Mr. Billy's ever told!

12:30.457 --> 12:36.721
Um, what is all this? That thing looks like
a summoned beast straight out of FF!

12:37.931 --> 12:40.269
We'll explain later.
Just fall back in the meantime.

12:40.352 --> 12:43.066
No, but... I can help, too...

12:43.275 --> 12:45.154
You can help by not getting killed.

12:47.074 --> 12:48.828
I'll come back when I've calmed my nerves!

12:49.120 --> 12:50.790
Just leave this to us!

12:51.959 --> 12:54.255
Looks like Unmove is still a scaredy-cat!

12:56.468 --> 13:00.058
We're in luck. He's the one
that got me last time, y'know.

13:02.939 --> 13:05.486
Bringing Burn along was a good idea.

13:06.154 --> 13:07.073
Huh, Boss?

13:12.124 --> 13:13.460
Boss?

13:16.174 --> 13:17.343
See? Didn't I tell you?

13:18.053 --> 13:19.305
No matter how you look at it...

13:19.556 --> 13:21.977
...he's a traitor!

13:26.152 --> 13:27.071
Top!

13:29.952 --> 13:32.666
<i>So fast...
What the hell is going on?</i>

13:35.505 --> 13:39.178
Unstoppable, huh?
It's a fine ability.

13:45.942 --> 13:48.446
But the shutoff condition is quite tricky.

13:50.158 --> 13:56.087
You can't stop unless the shape
of your body undergoes a dramatic change... was it?

13:57.632 --> 14:01.974
But still, in my current state,
that's not much of a drawback.

14:02.767 --> 14:05.982
You have my thanks... Undead.

14:11.367 --> 14:12.662
<i>My ability...</i>

14:13.121 --> 14:14.875
<i>...isn't kicking in.</i>

14:14.958 --> 14:16.545
<i>I knew I didn't like him!</i>

14:32.869 --> 14:35.248
What a marvel of a Negation ability.

14:35.959 --> 14:39.423
You can peer into people's hearts.

14:44.016 --> 14:46.187
One bound to protect.

14:48.526 --> 14:51.364
One bound to live and lead.

14:53.577 --> 14:57.752
One bound to fight powerful foes
to become stronger.

14:57.919 --> 15:02.011
Those are your visions
of justice being negated... yes?

15:02.261 --> 15:05.810
This is my Unjustice...?
How is he able to use it?

15:07.438 --> 15:11.279
Quite effective against people.
It's pretty handy.

15:11.279 --> 15:15.245
I'll gladly take these for myself.
Along with the Roundtable.

15:19.838 --> 15:21.550
Swat them away, Burn!

15:27.687 --> 15:28.773
Tatiana...

15:33.281 --> 15:34.200
Come.

15:35.243 --> 15:37.749
I need your ability.

15:38.083 --> 15:41.130
Now, for the main auction item of the night!

15:41.130 --> 15:46.474
A little Negator girl from Russia
who negates the touch of any and all things!

15:50.148 --> 15:51.652
You! What in the hell-

15:55.660 --> 15:57.204
You Tatiana?

15:58.624 --> 16:03.759
Put your gun in my mouth and fire.
That'll be enough to kill me.

16:05.930 --> 16:06.682
Mngh?

16:08.644 --> 16:15.700
I heard you're usually fed liquid food through a tube.
So I tried making these. So, how are they?

16:16.075 --> 16:16.827
Hm?

16:18.204 --> 16:21.753
What other flavors do you have?

16:22.004 --> 16:24.926
I saved your life.
Now return the favor.

16:25.343 --> 16:29.978
Listen. I'm sorry about the other day.
I thought we could maybe shake and patch things up.

16:30.771 --> 16:34.069
I can't...
As you can plainly see, I am-

16:34.320 --> 16:35.531
It's fine.

16:37.827 --> 16:40.373
I want to shake your current hand, Tatiana...

16:40.373 --> 16:43.421
...and I want you to shake mine as it is now.

16:44.507 --> 16:49.768
Someday, when we're free of our Negator powers
and have normal bodies...

16:51.521 --> 16:53.776
...let's go out together hand in hand, okay?

16:57.533 --> 16:58.326
Okay.

17:03.504 --> 17:06.217
You want to return to a normal body, don't you?

17:09.056 --> 17:09.891
Then...

17:15.861 --> 17:23.502
I know one thing. When you have no sense
of self-worth, but someone saves your life...

17:23.752 --> 17:27.927
...how influential that person can become for you.

17:30.975 --> 17:37.697
But what I don't know... is how sad it must be
to face betrayal by that same person!

17:54.271 --> 17:56.777
I see. You're not coming, then?

18:01.787 --> 18:05.961
Then you, too, are my enemy... Untouchable.

18:18.111 --> 18:19.989
Let's go, Burn.

18:22.703 --> 18:24.707
He plans on escaping by melting the ceiling!

18:24.791 --> 18:26.127
We must not let him escape!

18:27.588 --> 18:31.888
If he steals the Roundtable,
then we lose our only way to oppose God!

18:31.888 --> 18:37.441
We must retrieve it by any means...
We've come this far!

18:38.109 --> 18:40.948
If we don't settle this here,
it's all over!

18:47.712 --> 18:50.467
I got a boatload of questions, but...

18:50.467 --> 18:53.807
I'm on it.
But don't forget what ya said.

18:54.266 --> 18:56.771
We can use any means, right?

19:04.161 --> 19:07.375
Been a while,
but gimme a real doozy, Fuko!

19:07.585 --> 19:08.377
On it!

19:10.799 --> 19:11.843
I see...

19:12.595 --> 19:17.563
Relying on Fuko's Unluck?
Burn is quite strong, you know. Can you pull it off?

19:17.814 --> 19:19.274
We stand a chance.

19:19.692 --> 19:24.994
That girl on top of Burn's head
was the girl I described in September's report.

19:27.123 --> 19:30.380
As long as she's there,
orthodox attacks won't land.

19:33.929 --> 19:36.183
So we'll bank on Unluck's randomness.

19:40.316 --> 19:43.364
That makes sense.
Let's go with it.

19:47.497 --> 19:52.508
Attention, all Union members!
Billy has betrayed us and seized the Roundtable!

19:52.883 --> 19:56.516
We're mounting an operation centered
on Undead and Unluck!

19:56.850 --> 19:59.689
We must retrieve the Roundtable at all costs!

20:00.774 --> 20:03.362
Top priority is disabling Burn!

20:03.864 --> 20:07.287
As long as we stop Burn,
they can't walk off with the Roundtable!

20:07.580 --> 20:08.247
Nico!

20:08.624 --> 20:10.711
I want you to focus on treating Isshin and Top.

20:11.170 --> 20:15.971
Grant the lab members control
of the facility to stop Burn in its tracks!

20:16.890 --> 20:18.769
No choice, then.

20:18.769 --> 20:21.691
Mico, it's up to you.
Handle this.

20:22.067 --> 20:26.283
Wait, really, Pappy-
I mean, roger, Dr. Nico!

20:26.910 --> 20:28.245
Seriously?

20:28.622 --> 20:34.592
There is a chance they'll steal Artifacts along the way.
Shen, Phil, get to the depository.

20:34.884 --> 20:35.552
Yup.

20:36.261 --> 20:41.313
You have my permission to use any Artifact
you deem fit to pull off this operation!

20:41.940 --> 20:46.783
Chikara, I hate to ask, but I'd like you
to use your power to stop my bleeding.

20:47.618 --> 20:48.537
Can you do that?

20:49.037 --> 20:50.624
Yes! I'll give it my best shot!

20:51.333 --> 20:54.047
And, Tatiana.
As for you...

20:54.549 --> 20:55.509
Stand by.

21:00.853 --> 21:02.188
Don't worry.

21:02.815 --> 21:05.278
Just leave it to me, Tatiana.

21:05.696 --> 21:07.867
I'm sure there's some reason behind this.

21:10.581 --> 21:13.545
Mr. Billy is a kind, wonderful person.

21:14.964 --> 21:18.304
You know that better than anyone, right?

21:21.561 --> 21:22.521
Yeah.

21:23.147 --> 21:26.487
Please... go save Mr. Billy.

21:26.487 --> 21:27.197
I will.

21:28.617 --> 21:29.326
Fuko!

21:33.000 --> 21:34.587
Well, Tatiana...

21:35.421 --> 21:36.508
I'm off!

21:40.181 --> 21:41.350
Fuko.

21:43.605 --> 21:44.816
Begin the operation!

21:45.274 --> 21:48.364
All personnel, provide full support for Undead and Unluck!

21:48.489 --> 21:49.742
- Roger!
- Roger!

22:04.020 --> 22:09.030
TO BE CONTINUED

23:39.044 --> 23:39.879
PREVIEW

23:39.962 --> 23:43.970
<i>An enveloping lamentation.
The man said that this world was unfair.</i>

23:43.970 --> 23:46.976
<i>Will the hidden emotions ever be able to reach him?</i>

23:47.185 --> 23:51.611
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
episode 17-Outsmart.</i>

23:51.861 --> 23:53.990
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
